# Hungarian (LANG hu_HU) special cases: syllables, moving rule, dashes
SET UTF-8
LANG hu_HU
TRY aálmzkrtehsbnvoóöőiíuúüűéEO-
WORDCHARS -.%0123456789
COMPOUNDFLAG X
COMPOUNDBEGIN B
COMPOUNDEND E
COMPOUNDWORDMAX 2
COMPOUNDSYLLABLE 4 aáeéiíoóöőuúüű
SYLLABLENUM cJI
COMPOUNDROOT R
COMPOUNDPERMITFLAG W
FORBIDDENWORD !
ONLYINCOMPOUND O
CHECKCOMPOUNDREP
REP 1
REP x ksz
ICONV 4
ICONV 0__ 0
ICONV 1__ 1
ICONV .__ .
ICONV e__ e

PFX P Y 1
PFX P 0 ele/W .

PFX Q Y 1
PFX Q 0 be .

SFX c Y 1
SFX c 0 nak .

SFX J Y 1
SFX J 0 ban .

SFX I Y 1
SFX I 0 val .

SFX K Y 1
SFX K 0 ni/Z .

SFX Z Y 1
SFX Z 0 s .

SFX x Y 1
SFX x 0 ó/X .

SFX L Y 1
SFX L 0 hoz .
